  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tSelf Assessment \n\t\tSelf Assessment Help Guide\n\n### How to automatically pull employment information from HMRC (Self Assessment)\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 22 Apr, 2024 at 12:18 PM\n\n\t\tLocation: \n\nSelect client > HMRC Authorisation > authorise Capium with HMRC > create new return > within the return navigate to 'HMRC connect' > click on 'Populate employment data' \n\nVideo Tutorial:\n\nHelp Guide: \n\nThe first step is to authorise Capium with HMRC. This will connect the two portals and allow you to pull the employment information into Capium. Navigate into the clients dashboard > click on 'HMRC authorisation' > Click on 'HMRC authentication' \n\nProceed to create an SA100 as normal.\n\nThere is now  a new tab called 'HMRC connect'. This will show all employment income information that has been pulled from HMRC. To continue, click on 'Populate employment data'. \n\nCapium will then proceed to create the employment supplementary pages with all of the information entered in. \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115347\">Self Assessment </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188542\">Self Assessment Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to automatically pull employment information from HMRC (Self Assessment)\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Mon, 22 Apr, 2024 at 12:18 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Location:&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Select client &gt; HMRC Authorisation &gt; authorise Capium with HMRC &gt; create new return &gt; within the return navigate to 'HMRC connect' &gt; click on 'Populate employment data'&nbsp;</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>Video Tutorial:</strong></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><div class=\"fr-draggable\" style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/8899c3a536464bc5886921108a6ef569\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation\"></iframe></span></span></div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>Help Guide:&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">The first step is to authorise Capium with HMRC. This will connect the two portals and allow you to pull the employment information into Capium. <u dir=\"ltr\">Navigate into the clients dashboard &gt; click on 'HMRC authorisation' &gt; Click on 'HMRC authentication'</u>&nbsp;</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9161142016/original/dMdaQyUEzVXakdGPxJ87pqDFMwgWxLS0MA.png?1655198240\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9161142016\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Proceed to create an SA100 as normal.</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">There is now &nbsp;a new tab called 'HMRC connect'. This will show all employment income information that has been pulled from HMRC.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">To continue, click on 'Populate employment data'.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9161249194/original/Nwg700_Hk